    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Wilds is a simplistic third-person dungeon crawler with RPG turn-based combat. Control a small party of animals as they transport an important religious relic through hostile, war-torn territory. Customize your party, collect equipment, and vanquish foes as you progress through labyrinthine, procedurally generated wilderness expanses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat system, with unique status effects, damage types, and equipment bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory to give each animal the equipment and items that guarantee its success in battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are randomly generated, with different enemy and chest positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of weapons, each with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has unique stats and abilities and can be freely swapped into your party at any time.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Wilds is a simplistic third-person dungeon crawler with RPG turn-based combat. Control a small party of animals as they transport an important religious relic through hostile, war-torn territory. Customize your party, collect equipment, and vanquish foes as you progress through labyrinthine, procedurally generated wilderness expanses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat system, with unique status effects, damage types, and equipment bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory to give each animal the equipment and items that guarantee its success in battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are randomly generated, with different enemy and chest positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of weapons, each with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has unique stats and abilities and can be freely swapped into your party at any time.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "War of the Wilds is a third-person turn-based RPG dungeon-crawler set in a war-torn kingdom of animals. Traverse treacherous wilderness territory as you fight to deliver an important relic and end the war.",
